      "created_at": "2020-05-27T09:07:40Z",
      "updated_at": "2020-05-27T09:07:40Z",
      "body": "Hi everyone,\r\nI would also welcome a feature that allows storing DNS data related to each request in a separate table in the database. This feature would enable one to reason about the origin/destination of each request, which might be interesting concerning legislation like the GDPR or CCPA. The named [dns.resolve()](https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Mozilla/Add-ons/WebExtensions/API/dns/resolve) API of Firefox seems to be an excellent candidate to integrate this feature into OpenWPM.\r\nBest,\r\nTobias",
      "author_association": "CONTRIBUTOR",
